<title>POLAND: WBK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 13.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 13.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 13.12 vs   11.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   21.80 vs   17.94</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 37.47 vs   32.24</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	67.24 vs   58.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					106.56 vs   70.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  161.62 vs  116.46</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		283.89 vs  233.74</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     529.29 vs  440.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
